.env
.env.local
.env.development.local

# IMPORTANT: .env.development and .env.production ARE tracked (they hold non-secret defaults
# like API base URLs and public client IDs). Never put real secrets/API keys in those two files —
# use the *.local variants above instead (see security incident 2026-08-17: a real reCAPTCHA site
# key was committed via .env.development).
